    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krampus is a cartoony arcade-style rougelike. Find your way through a maze of  rooms to search for kids which have been naughty this year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/ce64880502a356edb1d5a04e9e9a3d58.poster.avif?t=1750458981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/ce64880502a356edb1d5a04e9e9a3d58.webm?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/ce64880502a356edb1d5a04e9e9a3d58.mp4?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Complete the list</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your tongue to help Santa serve justice to the brats, but remember to spare children who did nothing wrong. Use your skills to catch the children and outrun the nuns. Watch out, because they are faster than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/a529a570d5595ec7a2f65f8a6d21923e.poster.avif?t=1750458981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/a529a570d5595ec7a2f65f8a6d21923e.webm?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/a529a570d5595ec7a2f65f8a6d21923e.mp4?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Eat or be eaten</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to outperform the ticking clock before it's too late.\u00a0There is nobody to help you in there but yourself. See if you can survive long enough to get out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/7225e96256cd1d58c1c5e5e7a7a38cc9.poster.avif?t=1750458981\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/7225e96256cd1d58c1c5e5e7a7a38cc9.webm?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/7225e96256cd1d58c1c5e5e7a7a38cc9.mp4?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Compete on different layouts</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate levels tailored to your preference. Share the seed with your friends to challenge them to a highscore battle!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krampus is a cartoony arcade-style rougelike. Find your way through a maze of  rooms to search for kids which have been naughty this year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/ce64880502a356edb1d5a04e9e9a3d58.poster.avif?t=1750458981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/ce64880502a356edb1d5a04e9e9a3d58.webm?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/ce64880502a356edb1d5a04e9e9a3d58.mp4?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Complete the list</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your tongue to help Santa serve justice to the brats, but remember to spare children who did nothing wrong. Use your skills to catch the children and outrun the nuns. Watch out, because they are faster than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/a529a570d5595ec7a2f65f8a6d21923e.poster.avif?t=1750458981\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/a529a570d5595ec7a2f65f8a6d21923e.webm?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/a529a570d5595ec7a2f65f8a6d21923e.mp4?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Eat or be eaten</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to outperform the ticking clock before it's too late.\u00a0There is nobody to help you in there but yourself. See if you can survive long enough to get out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/7225e96256cd1d58c1c5e5e7a7a38cc9.poster.avif?t=1750458981\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/7225e96256cd1d58c1c5e5e7a7a38cc9.webm?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670640/extras/7225e96256cd1d58c1c5e5e7a7a38cc9.mp4?t=1750458981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Compete on different layouts</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate levels tailored to your preference. Share the seed with your friends to challenge them to a highscore battle!</p>",
